  "label": "Abortion Rights Movement",
  "description": "A social and political movement advocating for the legal right to abortion, often framed as a matter of personal autonomy and bodily integrity. The phrase 'my body my choice' is a central slogan of this movement, emphasizing that individuals should have the right to make decisions about their own reproductive health without government interference. The meme's depiction of erasing 'Abortion' directly opposes this movement and its core principles.",
